    "sections": {
        "description": "House Roofing is a clean and purpose-driven theme designed for roofing companies, contractors, and construction services. It offers a structured layout that helps present roofing services, project details, and business information with clarity. Built with a lightweight framework, the theme ensures smooth performance and easy customization through the Customizer. It supports essential features like responsive design, SEO-friendly structure, fast loading speed, and cross-browser compatibility. House Roofing also includes sections for service listings, testimonials, team profiles, and contact details, making it suitable for small to mid-sized roofing businesses. The theme works well with popular page builders, allowing flexible design adjustments without coding. Ideal for users looking to create a professional roofing website with a straightforward setup and organized content flow, ensuring better user experience overall."
    },
